dverse arbitration award over a terminated lease dispute with Ruby Infotech, **Rs 8.26 crore** plus interest and costs; net incremental cost impact not expected to exceed Rs 6.3 crore after fit-out write-offs.","**Ideaforge Technology** - receives a GST demand order under Section 74 for tax of INR 54.59 crore plus an equal penalty (**~Rs 109.17 crore** total) for FY22-24; company plans to appeal, citing a 2025 government clarification that drones attract 5% GST.","**Aether Industries** - the GST department drops its Rs 4.26 crore demand and show-cause notice tied to IPO-period tax credits, with no financial impact.","**TV Vision** - post-facto intimation of its 2nd Committee of Creditors meeting under CIRP; CIRP costs of Rs 7.00 lakh approved."],"credit_rating_changes":["**Acme Solar Holdings** - CRISIL revises its outlook to 'Positive' from 'Stable' (rating reaffirmed at CRISIL AA-) on bank facilities enhanced to **Rs 2,500 crore** from Rs 1,500 crore."],"other_notable":["**Agastya Energy and Infrastructure** - corrigendum details allocation of its pending preferential-issue proceeds (Rs 566.10 cr) toward subsidiaries' solar manufacturing capex _(enabling resolution ahead of the October 7 EGM - not an executed deal)_."]},"theme_titles":{"order_wins":"Order wins (notable vs mcap)","fund_raises_fresh_equity":"Fund raises (fresh equity)","equity_allotments":"Equity allotments (new)","m_and_a":"M&A / restructuring","capex_core":"Capex (core / topline)","business_updates":"Business updates","distress_risk":"Distress & risk","credit_rating_changes":"Credit-rating changes","other_notable":"Other notable"},"theme_rows":{"order_wins":[{"label":"KNACK","ticker":"KNACK","company":"Knack Packaging Limited","isin":"INE17QZ01016","pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/KNACK_6101_02102026174512_Intimation.pdf","mcap":2311.6},{"label":"TARIL","ticker":"TARIL","company":"Transformers And Rectifiers (India) Limited","isin":"INE763I01026","pdf_link":"https://nsearchiv